					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5336470); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5336470&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606357719" alt="cybersqyd" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5336470)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5336470); return false;" >cybersqyd</a></span> <span class="odate time_1606300104 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">25 Nov 2020 10:28</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4827669">
									

<blockquote>
<p>Long expositional tale short he says there was a group of ten, and one got a bit too aggressive. He ended up taking out seven members of the group before he himself fell, and after seeing the deaths of 80% of his friends, one offed himself, leaving one. This one, the D-Class, believes the aggressive one survived and is using the computer to find out.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I have really big concerns about this idea: bringing elder gods into this feels like a really weird mishmash of scales; where you have this like relatively small scale anomaly in the form of a search engine on a single computer coupled with all these grand, universe scale things like gods and a pattern screamer<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-430180-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-430180-1')">1</a></sup> and&#8230;I'm left feeling like a lot of this narrative feels complex over interesting?</p>
<p>Like my big concern is really 'how are you going to draw in the idea of there being elder gods who had a fight and one of them was cast out so hard that their non-existence is dangerous' here without it feeling almost like a complete non sequitur of a story?</p>
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">Footnotes</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-430180-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-430180-1')">1</a>. which is quite different from nothing btw; like the nonexistence zone you mention in Russia is probably <a href="/scp-3930">SCP-3930</a> and it's not just 'a thing that doesn't exist' but 'a thing that actively hates existing'</div>
</div>

