														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4828183">
									

<p>I understand that the idea seems over-complex, but you when you have 5000+ SCPs and you don't want someone to turn up and say 'that sounds like SCP-XXXX', complex is kind of your best bet.</p>
<p>I want to do something original but I can't go through all 5000S SCPs to work out what has and hasn't been done.</p>
<p>If this idea can't be salvaged then I do have a backup involving dreams. Unfortunately the more I develop this one the more it unravels, ironically.</p>

